@startuml DomainLayerPackages

title Financial Position Report Generator - Domain Layer Packages
left to right direction

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

package "asset_report.domain" as Domain #E3F0F8 {
  [__init__.py] as DomainAPI
  [models.py] as ModelsModule
  [repositories.py] as RepositoriesModule

  DomainAPI ..> ModelsModule : re-exports models
  DomainAPI ..> RepositoriesModule : re-exports contract
  RepositoriesModule ..> ModelsModule : FinancialStatementData
}

note bottom of Domain
  models.py defines Company, Money, ReportingPeriod,
  asset and liability items/statements, FinancialStatementData,
  and the ordered FinancialTimeSeriesData aggregate.

  repositories.py defines the
  FinancialStatementRepository protocol.

  Paired class diagram:
  04_domain_layer_classes.puml
end note

@enduml
